# UI-KEYS-1: the original's game keys (AnnoFrame.dll 0x100071b0) from the default start view (no
# look): P pauses and no turn is published while paused (game.ms unchanged), P resumes; F8, F5,
# F6, F7 set 50 / 100 / 200 / 400 % (SetSpeedCmd, applied at the next turn: each wait below also
# proves the turns resumed). Runs on the GPU window: a paused CPU window draws no frames.
resize 1024 768
wait frames 5
expect fact game.speed == 100
expect fact game.paused == 0
key p
expect fact game.paused == 1
# A turn already in flight may still publish: let it land, then nothing more may.
wait frames 30
note fact game.ms
wait frames 120
expect fact game.ms same
key p
expect fact game.paused == 0
key f8
wait fact game.speed == 50 within 5000
key f5
wait fact game.speed == 100 within 5000
key f6
wait fact game.speed == 200 within 5000
key f7
wait fact game.speed == 400 within 5000
key f5
wait fact game.speed == 100 within 5000
# Space stays the rebuild's extra pause key.
key space
expect fact game.paused == 1
key space
expect fact game.paused == 0
quit
